{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PathHold"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PathHold","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Headwire8PathHoldV","title":"PathHold","modules":[{"name":"Headwire"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PathHold"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A link’s hold lifts at any change in its health: the link coming back, the link failing and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recovering. Where nothing changes (a link that stays up but is slow), it lifts after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathHold\/retryWait"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A card’s hold is kept through every change but the card going: a card left because it showed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing reads standby once it stops, which says nothing of whether it would show something"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"now. It lifts when the card is unplugged, when another card comes into use, or when its Mac’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper says the displays changed ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathSelection\/release(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), else after "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathHold\/retryWait"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A stream that drew nothing is different again: its own health moves only because it was asked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and then paused, which says nothing new about it, so health never lifts its hold. Only time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lifts it (a wait that grows with each stall, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamTimeouts"},{"type":"text","text":"), or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/ConnectivityFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"taking it off when the stream may have changed: a new session on its link, the helper saying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"something new about its stream, or the person choosing Try again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each lifts by time only while a fixed retry is allowed: the app in front with nothing on screen."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwire\/pathhold"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathHold\/init(drewNothing:wait:at:)","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathHold\/init(of:health:at:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathHold\/health","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/PathHold\/l